~ start
match EventFlags.num_heaters_activated
	when 1
		=> return_to_den_1
	when 2
		=> return_to_den_2
	when 3
		=> asthma_attack
	else
		Error:This dialogue should never play. Heater Number is not 1 2 or 3
=> END

#Create 3 branches for each of the 
#number of heaters turned on
#This includes the long segment about the asthma attack

~ return_to_den_1
Az: Fenn! You did! Nice job, kid.
Fenn: Thanks, Az! I have a question, though.
Az: Shoot.
Fenn: Why do you need to get into your workshop?
Az: Cuz all my stuff is in there. My tools, my devices, trinkets. Valuable stuff.
Az:  I don't want a stranger going through my stuff, let alone a pathetic, wannabe wizard.
Fenn: But you said you needed something from there. What do you need?
Az: Oh... did I? I don't think so, kid. 
Fenn: You definitely did.
Az: sigh. Yeah, alright. Fine. I need an inhaler. Baba always has a few on him, and I keep the rest in my workshop.
Fenn: An inhaler? Like... for asthma?
Az: YES for asthma, kid. Why do think I won't melt down the ice here with fire breath?
Fenn: You'll get an attack from your own smoke?
Az: Yeah. It's not pretty.
Fenn: Hmm. That's why we need the heaters?
Az: Yeah. My Baba is insane about my asthma. He installed the heaters so I can control the temperature just right, in case it acts up.
Az: He taught me everything I know about blacksmithing, but it's so rare I can even do it. I swear he freaks out everytime I cough.
Fenn: Huh... that sucks.
Az: Hah. Yeah, you're right kid. Kinda does.
Az: Anyways, you should get a move on. We've got more heaters to turn on!
Fenn: Yeah! I'm on it!
Fade to black
Winston: Well, well, well. Asthma, eh?
do EventFlags.set_flag("AzWs-Return-1-Den", true)

=> END

~ return_to_den_2
Fenn: Az?
Az: 'Sup?
Fenn: Is your name Az because you have asthma?
Az: HAH! cough. Haha. No. Man, the amount of times I've heard that one. cough.
Az: My full name is Zara, but I've been Az since I was a kid. cough. Got the asthma diagnosis much later. Like the world was playing a joke.
Az: How about you, kid? Where's Fenn come from?
Wizard: A-Ahem.
Fenn: I don't really know! Mom says it means "brave"
Az: cough Hey, I mean. Pretty accurate as far as I'm concerned.
Wizard: Um. My- my nameth-
Az: Did you hear something?
Fenn: Did you say something Wizard man?
Wizard: Um. My nameth is Winston.
Fenn: Oh! Nice to meet-eth you Winston!
set EventFlags.winston_name = "Winston"
Winston: Nice- nice to meeteth thee too, I guesseth.
do EventFlags.set_flag("AzWs-Return-2-Den", true)

=> END

~ asthma_attack
Winston: Oh Az, it can not be that hard to melteth a little ice.
Az: Shut up.
Winston: Aw, what's wrong? Art thee afeard? Terrified of the despicable wizard who hath stolen thy workshop?
Az: Shut. Up.
Winston: Oh, what's this? It looks rather valuable.
Az: What are you doing? What do you have?
Winston: Hmph. Tis a lovely picture of you and your father.
Az: Stop. Stop this RIGHT NOW. I swear to Post.
Winston: The most WONDROUS Abdullah. Glorious Knight of Smithing. Heart of the Bay Leaf Palace. Pride of Kuva. Loving Husband and Father.
Winston: I truly wonder what that must be like.
SMASH
Az: That's it. You're done. I'm coming for you, you pathetic wizard SCUM.
Az approaches the door, takes a deep breath
Fenn walks in as she's doing this
Fenn: Az? What are you-
Az breathes fire over the ice, and completely melts it
She coughs and then collapses
Winston: Wait wh-
Fenn: Az! Wh- what did you do?
Az: cough cough. Got 'em.
Fenn: W-why? What's gonna happen to you?
Az: cough. I- cough. I'm fine.
Az: cough. G-go. cough. Get h-him.
Fenn: What? No! I'm not leaving.
Az: Go. cough. Winston.
Fenn: I'm not leaving you.
Az: cough. Go.
Fenn: NO! You're not okay, so I'm not leaving, so just- just shut up about it!
Az: cough
Az: O-okay. cough.
silence
Fenn: Wh-what can I do?
Az: I- I cough. d-don't know. cough.
Fenn: Please... don't... don't die.
Az: cough. No promises.
silence
cough
inhaler slides through door
Fenn: Is that?
Az: cough inhaler?
Fenn grabs the inhaler and brings it to Az
With Fenn's help, Az takes a breath
Silence for a few moments, another breath
Fenn: Are- are you okay?
Az: inhale. cough. in a bit, yeah.
Fenn: Okay.
silence, fade to black, deep inhale sound effect, fade out from black
Fenn: Are you sure you're okay.
Az: Hah, yeah. Don't worry kid, I'm good now.
Fenn: Are you sure?
Az: Yeah. Let's go get him.
do EventFlags.set_flag("AzWs-AsthmaAttack-Den", true)
=> END